&lt;p&gt;As a Scale Growth Account Executive at Anthropic, you&#39;ll own a portfolio of roughly 6-8 of our most strategic and fastest-scaling AI-native startup customers, driving expansion and retention by helping them harness the transformative potential of safe, frontier AI. These are companies that build on Anthropic&#39;s models and are now scaling quickly — your job is to grow with them. You&#39;ll leverage your consultative sales expertise to expand revenue across complex, multi-stakeholder accounts while becoming a trusted strategic advisor to founders and executive teams, helping them expand their AI capabilities and unlock new use cases. Working closely with GTM, Applied AI, product, and marketing teams, you&#39;ll identify expansion opportunities while ensuring our customers get maximum value from Anthropic&#39;s solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will combine strong commercial acumen with executive relationship management skills, focusing on growing large accounts through strategic expansion while maintaining high retention rates in a competitive market. By driving expanded deployment of Anthropic&#39;s products at the companies defining what AI-native looks like, you will help them scale their AI capabilities while advancing its safe and ethical development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive revenue growth through strategic account expansion and renewals across a focused portfolio (~6-8) of Anthropic&#39;s largest AI-native startup customers. Own the full sales cycle for upsell and renewal opportunities while maintaining strong retention rates&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain trusted relationships with founders, board members, and executive stakeholders, as well as the technical leaders (CTO, VP Engineering, Head of AI) who own model decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead strategic account planning including executive business reviews, health checks, usage and forecast reviews, and renewal negotiations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with customers to identify new use cases, workloads, and products that expand their AI capabilities with Anthropic&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Navigate complex commercial conversations — multi-stakeholder deals, evolving usage patterns, and competitive evaluations — in partnership with Applied AI and product teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the voice of the customer by gathering feedback and conveying market needs to inform our product roadmap&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and execute account strategies that align Anthropic&#39;s solutions with customer business objectives&lt;/p&gt;
